            "module": "digit-privacy-policy",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "PRIVACY_HEADER_2_SUB_2_DESC_3_SUBDESC_1",
            "message": "i. Please note that if you are a government employee or contractor, your name, designation, and official contact information (phone number, email ID, postal address) are not considered PII. ",
            "module": "digit-privacy-policy",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "PRIVACY_HEADER_2_SUB_2_DESC_3_SUBDESC_2",
            "message": "ii. Your national ID number or other ID document number, while not in itself PII, will be treated as PII. ",
            "module": "digit-privacy-policy",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "PRIVACY_HEADER_2_SUB_2_DESC_4",
            "message": "c. “Personally Identifiable Information” or “PII” refers to such data about you as would enable persons viewing that data to identify and/or contact you, such as your name, parent/guardian’s name, personal phone number, personal email ID, personal postal / residential address, photographs of you, photographs / scanned copies of your ID documents, and biometric information such as your fingerprint or retinal imprint.",
            "module": "digit-privacy-policy",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "PRIVACY_HEADER_2_SUB_2_DESC_5",
            "message": "d. 'Program Owner', 'Government Agency', and 'Relevant Government' all refer to [Name of Government Agency].",
            "module": "digit-privacy-policy",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "PRIVACY_HEADER_2_SUB_2_DESC_6",
